# valet-key profiles -- the built-in cwd resolver. Copy to
# ~/.config/valet-key/profiles and edit.
#
# Consulted only when every hooks/profile.d/ hook abstains (or there are none),
# so this is the answer for a box that needs no hooks at all.
#
# Lines: <profile> <dir>. When the context (git root, else $PWD) sits under
# <dir>, that profile is chosen; first match wins. An unmatched context falls
# back to the default profile ("personal"). A leading ~ expands to $HOME.
#
# Example: anything under ~/work runs the "work" profile (its own config +
# slot pool); everything else is personal.
#
#   work  ~/work
